---
title: Khawsa
source: https://zbhoy.notion.site/Khawsa-c3cc4ce6023742518a470deca78834a1?pvs=74
---

Chop @onion{1-1.5} and blend to paste (using chop setting).

Put into a #pot, high heat, and cook water off (optional add some @salt{}).

Add @oil{} and reduce heat to medium. Cook more till pink.

Add @ginger paste{3%tablespoons} and @garlic paste{3%tablespoons} (adrak and lassan), @red pepper powder{1/2%tablespoon}, and some @salt{} and cook. Add @oil{} if necessary.

Add @chicken{1%whole} (whole chicken cut into 8 pieces) and cook. Add @oil{} if needed.

Cook the @chicken{} until brown.

Add @water{} (one glass ish). Cover with a #lid and cook the @chicken{}.

Add @coconut milk{1%can} and cook. Taste and add more @coconut milk{} if needed.
